                                                "sense_id": "45780265-2f77-372c-9363-9794435a0a8d",
                                                "text": "Subtlety may indeed effect a victory at the deadening cost of a sin, but timeservingness can only get transitory advantage, while the damage of its untruthfulness leaves its corroding taint behind for ever."
